2.3.3. Diameter-velocity distribution
Besides with SMD and mean axial velocity, diameter-velocity distribution is also an important atomization characteristics. It shows the corresponding relation of the droplet diameter and the droplet velocity. At present research on diameter-velocity distribution is seldom, Belhadef et al. [154] and Santolaya et al. [103] shows the diameter-velocity distribution in there research, and the typical diameter-velocity distribution measured by PDA is shown in Fig. 22. Ayres et al. [155] proposed an prediction model for diameter-velocity distribution based on the maximum entropy formalism, and the typical predicted diameter-velocity distribution is shown in Fig. 23. The predictions agree well with the available data for the velocity distribution.
